WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.576
Start with a fresh session, then run the baseline.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.088
Choose bridge inspection to prioritise people's access to key destinations.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.220
The initial priorities are calculated. Waiting time is shortened here.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:15.440
The active task updates its priorities as new observations arrive.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:22.600
For this example, enter a ground-motion reading of zero point zero five g at bridge e seventy-three.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:27.576
Add the observation to update the model and the inspection priorities.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:28.700
The observation is being incorporated. Waiting time is shortened here.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:36.296
The reading is now in the evidence base. Next, check the results in Roadmap and the Bayesian network.
